================================================================================
                          SAFETY AND SCOPE NOTICE
================================================================================

This Work describes a modification to a UL-listed electric motor and its
motor starter. Performing this modification voids the motor's UL listing.

The Work is intended for private, personal use in a shop owned and
operated by the person building and validating the system. It is NOT
appropriate for, and MUST NOT be used in:

  - Any commercial workshop, business, or production environment
  - Any institutional setting: school, museum, community shop, makerspace
  - Any insured workspace where insurance is contingent on equipment
    remaining in its listed configuration
  - Any teaching or instructional context
  - Any environment where the operator is not the person who built and
    validated the system

In any of those settings, a listed replacement thermal protector is the
correct solution and this Work is not.

The reader is responsible for their own competence in mains-voltage
wiring, for compliance with electrical codes in their jurisdiction, and
for any harm that arises from following the guidance in this Work.
